/-! ## (A) THE ASSEMBLED LEADING-κ COMPOSED OBJECT AS A DETERMINED CLOSED FORM. -/

/-- ★★★ THE ASSEMBLED LEADING-κ COMPOSED OBJECT = A DETERMINED CLOSED FORM. The way-point-consistent
    leading-κ composed object — the banked `+70`-recombined tower, MINUS the isospin anti-screening
